{"seq":1,"slug":"http-conn-manager-routing-model","title":"HTTP 连接管理与路由匹配模型：虚拟主机、重试超时与熔断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/http-connection-filter-extensibility/http-conn-manager-routing-model","wordCount":2607,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"http-连接管理与路由匹配模型-虚拟主机-重试超时与熔断\">HTTP 连接管理与路由匹配模型：虚拟主机、重试超时与熔断</h1><p>Envoy 处理一次 HTTP 请求，不是&quot;查一张路由表&quot;这么一次动作，而是一个<strong>三阶段决策流水线</strong>：HCM 先按 scope 选出用哪张路由表，再按 <code>Host</code>/<code>:authority</code> 选出虚拟主机，最后在该虚拟主机内按路径/头/cookie 匹配出唯一一条路由。路由一旦确定，它同时锁定三组行为参数：<strong>转发目标（cluster 或 weighted_clusters）、超时预算、重试与熔断策略</strong>。这三组写在同一份 <code>RouteAction</code> 上，&quot;这条请求该发给谁&quot;和&quot;发不出去时怎么办&quot;因此是同一个决策的产物。跨境电商链路的 504 高发、尾延迟撕裂与促销期雪崩，几乎都能落回这三组参数中的某一组没配对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三阶段决策与一次路由的三种参数\">核心概念：三阶段决策与一次路由的三种参数</h2><p>**HCM（HTTP Connection Manager）**是网络层过滤器链里的 HTTP 解析与路由中枢，把一个 TCP 连接提升为有语义的 HTTP 请求流。<strong>VirtualHost</strong> 回答&quot;这条请求属于哪个站&quot;，按 <code>Host</code>/<code>:authority</code> 匹配；<strong>Route</strong> 回答&quot;这条请求该发给谁&quot;，按 <code>:path</code>、请求头、query 与 cookie 匹配；<strong>RouteAction</strong> 是命中后附带的行为参数，同时携带转发目标、超时预算（<code>timeout</code>、<code>idle_timeout</code>、<code>per_try_timeout</code>）与稳定性策略（<code>retry_policy</code> 与 cluster 侧 circuit breakers）。<strong>这三样东西绑定在同一个决策产物上</strong>——路由选择一旦完成，转发目标与&quot;失败时怎么办&quot;就同时被锁定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hcm-的请求生命周期与路由表选择\">HCM 的请求生命周期与路由表选择</h2><p><code>envoy.filters.network.http_connection_manager</code> 的工作分四步：解析（HTTP/1.1 或经 ALPN 协商的 h2）、组装 <code>RequestHeaderMap</code>、选定路由、交给 HTTP 过滤器链与 router 过滤器（<code>envoy.filters.http.router</code>）。官方 <em>HTTP routing</em> 概述指出，HCM 持有 <code>RouteConfiguration</code> 供其 HTTP 过滤器共用——router 是主要消费者，限流等过滤器也读取已选中的路由（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/http/http_routing\">https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/http/http_routing</a>）。</p>\n<p>启用 scoped routing 时，HCM 为每个请求动态计算一个 <strong>scope key</strong>，用它选一张路由表。scope 匹配要求 key 的<strong>片段数一致</strong>，再按顺序逐段比对；缺一个片段即视为 <code>NULL</code>，任何 scope 都不匹配。多租户网关里这意味着：按 <code>Host</code> 首段做 scope key 时，租户域名层级一旦不齐（<code>a.shop.com</code> vs <code>shop.com</code>），部分流量会整段落进默认路由表。路由选定后 HCM 会缓存本请求的路由决策，即使决策含随机性也保持稳定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;Downstream 连接&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;HCM 解析请求&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;scoped_routes&lt;br/&gt;是否启用&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[&quot;计算 scope key&lt;br/&gt;选 RouteConfiguration&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[&quot;使用内联/单一&lt;br/&gt;RouteConfiguration&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;按 Host/:authority&lt;br/&gt;选 VirtualHost&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{&quot;匹配顺序&lt;br/&gt;精确 → 前缀 → 正则&quot;}&#10;  G --&gt;|命中| H[&quot;Route + RouteAction&lt;br/&gt;锁定 cluster/超时/重试&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt;|全不命中| I[&quot;404 或 default route&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; J[&quot;Router 过滤器&lt;br/&gt;转发 + 重试 + 熔断计数&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"Downstream 连接\"] --&gt; B[\"HCM 解析请求\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"scoped_routes&lt;br/&gt;是否启用\"}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[\"计算 scope key&lt;br/&gt;选 RouteConfiguration\"]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[\"使用内联/单一&lt;br/&gt;RouteConfiguration\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"按 Host/:authority&lt;br/&gt;选 VirtualHost\"]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{\"匹配顺序&lt;br/&gt;精确 → 前缀 → 正则\"}\n  G --&gt;|命中| H[\"Route + RouteAction&lt;br/&gt;锁定 cluster/超时/重试\"]\n  G --&gt;|全不命中| I[\"404 或 default route\"]\n  H --&gt; J[\"Router 过滤器&lt;br/&gt;转发 + 重试 + 熔断计数\"]</pre><h2 id=\"虚拟主机匹配与域优先级\">虚拟主机匹配与域优先级</h2><p><code>VirtualHost</code> 的匹配输入是 <code>:authority</code>（HTTP/2）或 <code>Host</code> 头（HTTP/1.1），<code>domains</code> 支持精确域名、前缀通配（<code>*.shop.com</code>）、后缀通配（<code>shop.*</code>）与 <code>*</code>，遵循<strong>最特异者胜出</strong>：精确优先于通配，通配中前缀越长越特异，<code>*</code> 是最后兜底；没有 <code>*</code> 兜底时请求以 404 结束。三个高发的坑：<strong>端口写进 domain 就失配</strong>（<code>Host: shop.com:443</code> 与 <code>domains: [&quot;shop.com&quot;]</code> 通常能匹配，因为 Envoy 会剥离端口，但客户端用非标准端口且配置里显式写了端口时判定按字面走）；<strong>虚拟主机不匹配 ≠ 路由不匹配</strong>（它发生在更早阶段，看 <code>config_dump</code> 时应先确认请求落到哪条 virtual_host）；<strong>virtual cluster 只是统计维度</strong>，不参与转发决策。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配层</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>匹配方式</th>\n<th>不命中后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Scope（scoped_routes）</td>\n<td>片段化 key</td>\n<td>片段数一致后逐段比对</td>\n<td>落默认表或无表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VirtualHost</td>\n<td><code>:authority</code> / <code>Host</code></td>\n<td>精确 / 前缀通配 / 后缀通配 / <code>*</code></td>\n<td>404</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Route path</td>\n<td><code>:path</code></td>\n<td>精确 / 前缀 / safe_regex / 分隔前缀</td>\n<td>尝试下一条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Route header</td>\n<td>任意请求头</td>\n<td>精确 / 前缀 / 后缀 / 正则 / 存在性</td>\n<td>尝试下一条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Route query</td>\n<td>query 参数</td>\n<td>精确 / 正则 / 存在性</td>\n<td>尝试下一条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路由匹配-路径类型-条件与优先级\">路由匹配：路径类型、条件与优先级</h2><p>一条 <code>Route</code> 的 <code>match</code> 由路径、头、query 与（较新版本）<code>connect_matcher</code> 组合而成。路径有四种写法，选择直接决定行为与安全性：<strong><code>path</code></strong> 精确匹配，最快也最不易出错，适合 <code>/healthz</code>、<code>/api/v1/pay</code> 这类固定端点；<strong><code>prefix</code></strong> 是纯字符串前缀，<code>/api</code> 会匹配 <code>/api</code>、<code>/api/</code>、<code>/apixyz</code>——<strong>这是越权配置事故的常见来源</strong>；<strong><code>path_separated_prefix</code></strong>（新推荐）按路径段比较，<code>/api</code> 匹配 <code>/api</code> 与 <code>/api/users</code> 但<strong>不匹配</strong> <code>/apixyz</code>；<strong><code>safe_regex</code></strong> 用 RE2 语法、无回溯风险，仅在前三种表达不了时使用，匹配开销最高。</p>\n<p><code>case_sensitive</code> 对 prefix 与 path 生效，默认 <code>true</code>。header 与 cookie 匹配是<strong>附加条件</strong>：官方文档明确指出路由匹配支持任意请求头与 <code>Cookie</code> 匹配（用 <code>cookies</code> 匹配器而不用手工解析头）。条件越多的路由越特异，Envoy 在同类匹配内<strong>按特异度收敛</strong>而非简单按列表顺序。较新版本的 <strong>generic match tree</strong>（<code>xds.type.matcher.v3.Matcher</code> 树）可对任意头做次线性时间的匹配，且<strong>解析出的 Route 自身的 match 必须额外满足</strong>才算命中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时体系-从-route-timeout-到-stream-idle\">超时体系：从 route timeout 到 stream idle</h2><p>Envoy 的超时不是一个数，而是一组粒度不同的旋钮，配错任何一个都会产生&quot;看起来后端慢、实际是代理提前掐断&quot;的 504：<strong><code>RouteAction.timeout</code></strong>（原 <code>route.timeout</code>）是整个上游请求的总预算，默认 <strong>15 秒</strong>，也是重试的<strong>总预算</strong>——<code>num_retries</code> 次尝试共用这 15 秒，不是每次各 15 秒；<strong><code>RouteAction.idle_timeout</code></strong> 是上游&quot;没有字节流动&quot;的容忍时间，长轮询/SSE/大文件下载必须显式放宽或置 0；<strong><code>per_try_timeout</code></strong> 是单次尝试上限，必须 ≤ route timeout，设了它才能让失败快速触发重试而非耗尽总预算；<strong><code>max_stream_duration</code></strong> 对整条流（含重试）设硬上限；<strong>HCM 的 <code>stream_idle_timeout</code></strong> 是下游侧空闲超时，默认 5 分钟。设总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、单次尝试上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、最多重试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次，则一次请求最多消耗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>worst</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{worst}} = \\min\\left(T,\\ (n+1)\\cdot t_p\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">worst</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 未设，单次尝试可吃掉整个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，重试就形同虚设——这是&quot;配了重试却从不生效&quot;的根本原因。先测后端 P99 取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mtext>P99</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_p \\approx \\text{P99}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P99</span></span></span></span></span></span>，再让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n+1)\\cdot t_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 并留余量即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试策略-条件-退避与重试预算\">重试策略：条件、退避与重试预算</h2><p>重试由 <code>retry_policy</code> 定义，最重要的字段是 <strong><code>retry_on</code></strong>——一段逗号分隔的条件串，Envoy 只对显式列出的条件重试。<strong>默认 <code>retry_on</code> 为空意味着不重试</strong>，这一点常被误解。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>幂等安全</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>connect-failure</code></td>\n<td>连接未建立</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>默认开启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reset</code></td>\n<td>上游 RST</td>\n<td>视方法而定</td>\n<td>仅幂等方法开启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gateway-error</code></td>\n<td>502/503/504</td>\n<td>视方法而定</td>\n<td>GET 开启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>5xx</code></td>\n<td>任意 5xx</td>\n<td>危险</td>\n<td>配合 <code>retriable-status-codes</code> 收窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>envoy-ratelimited</code></td>\n<td>本地/远程限流拒绝</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>谨慎开启，防放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retriable-4xx</code></td>\n<td>409 等特定 4xx</td>\n<td>视业务</td>\n<td>按接口白名单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个配套旋钮不可忽略。<strong><code>num_retries</code></strong> 是并行重试的并发上限（同一请求最多几个 retry 在飞），不是&quot;总共重试几次&quot;的计数；配合 <code>retry_host_predicate</code> 与 <code>retry_priority</code> 可把重试导向<strong>尚未试过的 host 或更高优先级的 locality</strong>。<strong>退避</strong>由 <code>retry_backoff</code> 控制，Envoy 使用带抖动的指数退避，不开退避的固定间隔重试在故障期会形成同步重试风暴。<strong>重试预算</strong>是最被低估的一项：官方在熔断文档中明确<strong>推荐用 retry budget 而非静态 <code>max_retries</code> 上限</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/circuit_breaking\">https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/circuit_breaking</a>），因为静态上限无法阻止&quot;每个请求都重试一次&quot;把上游压垮。一条纪律：<strong>只对幂等请求重试</strong>——支付、下单、库存扣减是非幂等接口，若无脑开 <code>5xx</code> 重试，一次超时会变成多次扣款；正确做法是后端提供幂等键，Envoy 侧对非幂等方法<strong>显式关闭重试</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断-阈值-优先级与-panic-阈值\">熔断：阈值、优先级与 panic 阈值</h2><p>熔断回答&quot;上游已经不行了，我还要往上送多少&quot;，在 <strong>cluster</strong> 上按 <strong>priority</strong>（通常是 <code>DEFAULT</code> 与 <code>HIGH</code>）分别维护一组阈值。API 参考给出的默认值（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto\">https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>max_connections</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>到该 cluster 所有 host 的连接总数（含 draining）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_pending_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>排队等待连接的请求数（非 HTTP 流量下等价于连接限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>未完成的并行请求数（仅 HTTP）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_retries</code></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>未完成的并行重试数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retry_budget.budget_percent</code></td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>重试占活跃+待处理请求的比例上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retry_budget.min_retry_concurrency</code></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>预算下限，保证低频重试仍可发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_connection_pools</code></td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>限制该 cluster 的并发连接池数量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键语义点：<strong>默认值是开启的</strong>，Envoy 用&quot;温和的默认值&quot;防止无界增长。熔断计数器在 <strong>worker 线程间共享</strong>，但实现是最终一致的，高并发下可能<strong>短暂超限</strong>几个请求。panic 阈值是第二层：当 <code>HIGH</code> 优先级的健康 host 占比跌破 <strong>panic threshold</strong>（默认 50%）时，Envoy 会<strong>忽略健康检查结果、把流量发给所有 host</strong>，避免&quot;因大多数 host 被判不健康而彻底无可用上游&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三者协同-一条跨境电商链路怎么配\">三者协同：一条跨境电商链路怎么配</h2><p>假设一个部署在新加坡的 Envoy 网关，要在&quot;东南亚用户 → 新加坡入口 → 东京库存服务&quot;链路上兼顾尾延迟与稳定性：GET 商详/搜索类开 <code>retry_on: connect-failure,reset,gateway-error</code>、<code>per_try_timeout: 300ms</code>、<code>num_retries: 2</code> 并配退避；POST 下单/支付类只开 <code>connect-failure</code>、<strong>不重试 5xx</strong>、依赖后端幂等键。两类熔断阈值都从实测并发反推（峰值 × 1.2 左右），priority 按同 AZ &gt; 跨 AZ 排列。三条落地经验：<strong>超时链要自洽</strong>（<code>per_try_timeout</code> 取后端 P99，<code>route.timeout</code> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n+1)\\cdot t_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加握手余量）；<strong>熔断阈值应从实测并发反推</strong>，而非照抄 1024——跨境链路连接池小、RTT 长，1024 往往远高于真实容量，等于没设熔断；<strong>重试与熔断要成对配置</strong>——开了重试却没配 <code>retry_budget</code>，故障期重试会把熔断的 <code>max_requests</code> 顶满，反而加速雪崩。</p>\n<p><code>config_dump</code> 能摊开当前生效的阈值，cluster 的 <code>upstream_rq_retry</code>、<code>upstream_rq_retry_overflow</code>、<code>cx_open</code>、<code>rq_pending_open</code> 是判断&quot;重试是否超额、熔断是否开合&quot;的直接证据。想理解这些计数怎么产生，需先看清 HCM 与 worker 线程的协作模型（<code>../1_envoy-architecture-data-plane/2_envoy-thread-model-connection-lifecycle.md</code>）；想理解配置怎么被控制面按名下发，见 <code>../2_xds-control-plane-protocol/1_xds-protocol-family-discovery-model.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>HCM 的路由是一个三阶段流水线：选 scope 路由表 → 选 VirtualHost → 选 Route，命中后由 RouteAction 一次性锁定转发目标、超时与重试熔断策略。落地守住四条线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>匹配要精确</strong>：路径优先用 <code>path_separated_prefix</code> 而非裸 <code>prefix</code>，避免 <code>/api</code> 吃掉 <code>/apikeys</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>超时要有层级</strong>：保持 <code>per_try_timeout ≤ route.timeout</code>，且 <code>route.timeout</code> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n+1)\\cdot t_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的整链预算。</li>\n<li><strong>重试分清幂等</strong>：只对幂等方法自动重试，非幂等接口依赖后端幂等键而不是代理重发。</li>\n<li><strong>熔断按实测设</strong>：阈值从真实并发反推并配 retry budget，避免默认值在峰值时误杀或失防。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"HTTP 连接管理与路由匹配模型：虚拟主机、重试超时与熔断","id":"http-连接管理与路由匹配模型-虚拟主机-重试超时与熔断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三阶段决策与一次路由的三种参数","id":"核心概念-三阶段决策与一次路由的三种参数"},{"level":2,"text":"HCM 的请求生命周期与路由表选择","id":"hcm-的请求生命周期与路由表选择"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟主机匹配与域优先级","id":"虚拟主机匹配与域优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"路由匹配：路径类型、条件与优先级","id":"路由匹配-路径类型-条件与优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"超时体系：从 route timeout 到 stream idle","id":"超时体系-从-route-timeout-到-stream-idle"},{"level":2,"text":"重试策略：条件、退避与重试预算","id":"重试策略-条件-退避与重试预算"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断：阈值、优先级与 panic 阈值","id":"熔断-阈值-优先级与-panic-阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"三者协同：一条跨境电商链路怎么配","id":"三者协同-一条跨境电商链路怎么配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"控制面故障与 xDS 异常排查：NACK 风暴、资源不生效与缓存治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/xds-control-plane-protocol/control-plane-failure-debugging"},"next":{"title":"过滤器链扩展机制：L4/L7 Filter、ext_authz 与 Lua/Wasm 扩展点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/envoy-xds-data-plane-proxy-extension/http-connection-filter-extensibility/filter-chain-extension-mechanism"}}